  "body": "This creates a situation where we have an options object with required options.\r\n\r\nSure, it means the output of `get` can be passed to `set` (after modifications), but this is racey, and not something we should encourage.\r\n\r\nYou can reduce some of the racing with web locks, but since responses can also set cookies, it isn't a total solution.",
